  "saferAlternatives": [
    "Send only public addresses and unsigned transactions or messages; never send a seed, private key or signing permission. Toll does not need them.",
    "check_tx answers ALLOW, WARN or BLOCK; pre_buy_check also answers WAIT while a coin is still being read: call it again after the seconds given, and do not buy before it settles.",
    "Treat BLOCK as a stop and show every WARN to the person before they sign or buy.",
    "Chain checks read Robinhood Chain; Stock Token company data comes from SEC filings and larp_check reads a project's own site, posts and code. Each answer names its source and time.",
